{
  "_comment": [
    "Custom areas for the per-zone breakdown. Copy to zones.json and pass it with",
    "--zones zones.json. Two forms are supported:",
    "  { \"name\": \"...\", \"lat\": 41.9, \"lon\": -87.7 }   nearest-centroid (no gaps, no overlaps)",
    "  { \"name\": \"...\", \"bbox\": [west, south, east, north] }   exact box, wins over any centroid",
    "Bboxes are checked first, so use one to carve out a precise area you care",
    "about (your block, a specific suburb) and let centroids handle the rest.",
    "Anything further than 60km from every centroid is bucketed into a labelled",
    "grid cell so no customers are silently dropped."
  ],
